WEBVTT

00:06.610 --> 00:08.805
It's Shalma Rufis!

00:12.683 --> 00:16.312
That damn Chelsea Rorec...

00:16.887 --> 00:19.981
Next time we meet,
I'll be sure to pay you back!

00:20.157 --> 00:21.091
- Get her to the hospital!

00:21.091 --> 00:21.989
- Get her to the hospital!
- Yes, sir!

00:28.298 --> 00:31.233
It seems that she's
managed to get away.

00:31.301 --> 00:36.068
Wherever she may have gone,
we'll definitely find her.

00:47.284 --> 00:49.582
Salute to Lord Kashin!

01:37.401 --> 01:43.203
Pairon, I have the report from
the search party looking for Teil.

01:50.581 --> 01:51.479
Let's hear it.

01:52.349 --> 01:55.682
It seems that they have
recovered Shalma Rufis...

01:55.752 --> 01:57.720
...who had gone to fight with Teil.

01:59.523 --> 02:01.650
Although she has been
severely hurt...

02:01.725 --> 02:04.125
...none of her injuries appear
to be life-threatening.

02:05.162 --> 02:08.598
The search for Teil still continues.

02:08.665 --> 02:11.190
As yet, they have found
no sign of him.

02:12.135 --> 02:15.195
What about the wind user
and Chelsea Rorec?

02:16.473 --> 02:19.033
We haven't been able to
track them down yet.

02:20.177 --> 02:22.236
They got away.

02:35.626 --> 02:36.388
Shiel!

02:39.997 --> 02:41.191
That means...!

02:42.933 --> 02:44.594
It sounds like they're all okay.

02:45.469 --> 02:46.629
What a relief!

02:49.640 --> 02:52.268
Thank you, Shiel.

03:10.928 --> 03:14.386
Yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

03:14.464 --> 03:18.025
kokoro umore naku nari sou

03:18.101 --> 03:21.662
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

03:21.738 --> 03:24.229
taisetsu na koto wa

03:24.308 --> 03:26.572
oshiete yo

03:26.643 --> 03:28.167
ne

03:28.378 --> 03:33.338
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:33.417 --> 03:38.081
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:38.822 --> 03:42.519
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:42.592 --> 03:46.119
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:46.196 --> 03:49.495
osoreru koto nante nani

03:49.566 --> 03:53.366
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:53.437 --> 03:56.964
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:57.040 --> 04:00.532
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

04:00.610 --> 04:04.046
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

04:04.114 --> 04:07.641
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

04:07.718 --> 04:13.657
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

04:26.937 --> 04:29.940
The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light
The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light.

04:29.940 --> 04:34.138
The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light

04:38.749 --> 04:40.341
Hey, wake up! Blondie!

04:40.550 --> 04:41.482
Wake up!

04:41.918 --> 04:44.216
Where are we supposed
to go now?!

04:45.389 --> 04:47.857
How are we supposed to
get out of here?!

04:49.826 --> 04:53.159
She did say that she
overused her power.

04:54.398 --> 04:55.296
So?

04:55.665 --> 05:00.796
As I recall, back when Ruri used
her power of resurrection...

05:01.071 --> 05:03.301
...she fell asleep for three days.

05:06.643 --> 05:11.273
Are you saying Blondie's going
to sleep for the next three days?!

05:11.581 --> 05:13.640
What are we going to do for food?!

05:13.850 --> 05:15.374
S-stop yelling at me!

05:15.986 --> 05:17.112
I heard a voice over there!

05:17.854 --> 05:19.378
It might be the intruders!

05:19.523 --> 05:20.649
Don't let them get away!

05:22.059 --> 05:23.390
Company soldiers?!

05:30.767 --> 05:33.133
Rumina and all are safe.

05:42.345 --> 05:44.210
I just don't understand.

05:44.281 --> 05:44.838
Huh?

05:45.082 --> 05:48.882
Why are you so obsessed
with that wind user guy?

05:53.056 --> 05:54.580
He's important to me.

05:55.759 --> 05:57.056
Important to you?

05:58.328 --> 06:00.558
He's funny and kind.

06:01.431 --> 06:02.864
He's serious, and...

06:05.702 --> 06:07.863
It's hard to put it in words...

06:07.938 --> 06:09.906
...but I just want him near me.

06:11.341 --> 06:13.468
I want to see him as soon as I can.

06:15.479 --> 06:18.346
Don't you have someone like that?

06:20.517 --> 06:21.176
No, I don't.

06:23.887 --> 06:27.823
I'm only in the Company
because I happen to have a power.

06:28.191 --> 06:32.628
And before that,
I was always alone.

06:33.396 --> 06:34.294
Shiel...

06:41.671 --> 06:43.536
They're getting closer, Rumina!

06:43.640 --> 06:44.834
I know that!

06:46.643 --> 06:47.132
Stop!

06:49.412 --> 06:51.073
We're just going to have to
charge through!

06:51.748 --> 06:53.113
You take care of Blondie!

06:53.183 --> 06:53.877
What?!

06:57.921 --> 06:58.853
Here I come!

07:01.158 --> 07:05.026
Shiel, I'll stay close to you.

07:07.063 --> 07:09.588
I'll be like your older sister.

07:11.134 --> 07:11.964
Why?

07:12.702 --> 07:16.331
Because I was once like you.

07:16.773 --> 07:17.296
What?

07:18.441 --> 07:22.070
I was all alone
in the Company back then...

07:22.145 --> 07:25.410
...when Chelsea told me...

07:31.888 --> 07:36.325
All right, then.
I will be your older sister.

07:37.994 --> 07:41.259
From that day,
I was no longer alone.

07:42.532 --> 07:44.500
I had someone important
in my life.

07:46.903 --> 07:49.337
So? What do you think?

07:54.377 --> 07:55.605
We finally tracked you down!

07:56.947 --> 07:58.278
Asagi swordsmanship!

07:58.348 --> 07:59.440
- Wind...!
- Miss Rorec!

08:01.251 --> 08:04.618
Get your grubby hands
off of Miss Rorec!

08:05.288 --> 08:07.848
Wake up, Miss Rorec!

08:07.924 --> 08:08.856
Please wake up!

08:10.694 --> 08:12.093
Uh, um...

08:12.162 --> 08:14.926
What did you do to Miss Rorec?!

08:14.998 --> 08:16.863
Wh-What do you mean?

08:16.933 --> 08:18.594
We haven't done anything!

08:18.668 --> 08:22.536
The idiot overused her power
and now she's fast asleep.

08:25.308 --> 08:27.401
Don't you dare insult Miss Rorec!

08:31.014 --> 08:32.982
Emilia, you take care
of Miss Rorec.

08:38.588 --> 08:40.681
Come on.
You two have to hide too!

08:43.960 --> 08:45.791
Have you seen the intruders
from the surface?

08:47.330 --> 08:49.264
No. Haven't seen anyone here.

08:50.634 --> 08:51.794
Right.

08:51.868 --> 08:53.392
They must be down
the next corridor!

08:53.470 --> 08:54.061
Hurry!

09:00.677 --> 09:04.204
Hey, aren't you guys
with the Company?

09:04.681 --> 09:05.477
Of course we are.

09:05.548 --> 09:07.743
We're proud soldiers
of the Company.

09:07.984 --> 09:09.474
Then, why...

09:09.552 --> 09:10.985
I'll tell you.

09:11.788 --> 09:12.812
We are...

09:14.758 --> 09:18.751
Chelsea Rorec Fan Club
member number 2...

09:18.828 --> 09:20.853
...Emilia Runarif!

09:21.498 --> 09:23.591
And member number 3...

09:23.667 --> 09:25.464
...Jilherts Mesett!

09:26.569 --> 09:29.436
Chelsea Rorec Fan Club?

09:33.343 --> 09:37.746
So instead of just being "The Maiden,"
she's now my sister?

09:41.251 --> 09:42.809
Doesn't sound too bad.

09:43.820 --> 09:46.015
What are you grinning about,
Shiel?

09:47.057 --> 09:48.547
Nothing!

10:11.214 --> 10:13.512
What? I've never seen him before.

10:20.924 --> 10:22.949
Those are Pairon's quarters.

10:29.132 --> 10:30.258
I see.

10:30.500 --> 10:34.197
So Lord Kashin's finally
made a decision.

10:35.438 --> 10:38.168
So, the time has come.

10:38.575 --> 10:39.303
Yes.

10:40.176 --> 10:44.078
The seal shall be broken
and the Dragons will rise...

10:44.147 --> 10:46.741
...after consuming the life
of the Maiden.

10:48.251 --> 10:51.982
The Maiden's life
will be a small price to pay.

10:52.889 --> 10:54.584
The Maiden's life?

10:55.258 --> 10:56.725
You mean, my sister's?

11:02.265 --> 11:06.361
The Company wants to
take the life of my sister!

11:08.271 --> 11:09.533
All clear.

11:21.518 --> 11:22.746
Amazing!

11:22.819 --> 11:26.152
Who would've thought there
was a city this big underground!

11:26.456 --> 11:28.390
Uh, right! All right, Ginnosuke!

11:28.458 --> 11:30.323
Look. You settle down.

11:31.861 --> 11:34.830
Is the Company's headquarters
in this city?

11:35.298 --> 11:36.265
No way.

11:36.466 --> 11:40.095
Common people can't get
near the headquarters so easily.

11:40.303 --> 11:41.099
Right.

11:47.577 --> 11:50.239
Hey! It's been a while, Emilia!

11:50.447 --> 11:51.778
Hi!

11:53.049 --> 11:55.449
Oh, and Jil's with you.

11:55.652 --> 11:59.418
Those Company uniforms look
very good on the both of you.

11:59.923 --> 12:00.617
Th-Thanks...

12:01.257 --> 12:04.283
Uncle, I think I mentioned it
in my email earlier today...

12:04.360 --> 12:06.351
Hey, don't worry about it.

12:06.696 --> 12:09.460
We're able to live peacefully
like this...

12:09.532 --> 12:11.932
...thanks to you and the Company!

12:12.335 --> 12:12.858
Huh?

12:20.009 --> 12:21.738
This is my uncle's hotel.

12:22.145 --> 12:25.114
He might be rough around
the edges, but don't worry.

12:25.448 --> 12:26.972
Why are you hiding us?

12:27.317 --> 12:29.547
We don't really care about you!

12:29.652 --> 12:32.678
All we care about
is saving Miss Rorec!

12:33.323 --> 12:38.124
But isn't Chelsea considered
a traitor to the Company?

12:38.361 --> 12:38.986
Huh?

12:41.097 --> 12:44.464
But we believe in Miss Rorec!

12:45.735 --> 12:49.432
I'm sure she has some very good
reasons for doing what she did.

12:49.506 --> 12:54.273
We joined the search party so that
we could find out on our own.

12:54.744 --> 12:56.234
Oh, right...

12:57.780 --> 13:02.080
I've heard that the wind user
is headed in this direction.

13:05.488 --> 13:08.514
That's why I invited these guys.

13:10.093 --> 13:11.117
I see.

13:18.835 --> 13:20.826
No one's getting in my way.

13:33.182 --> 13:34.206
Sister...

13:40.256 --> 13:41.223
Why?

13:44.060 --> 13:45.084
My heart...

13:46.529 --> 13:47.996
My heart is aching...

13:48.064 --> 13:49.759
I'll stay close to you.

13:49.832 --> 13:53.199
I'll be like your older sister.

14:05.014 --> 14:06.538
What are you doing, Shiel?

14:08.952 --> 14:10.214
Shiel! What're you...?!

14:18.861 --> 14:20.419
I'm sorry, Raichi.

14:22.699 --> 14:23.631
Shiel!

14:24.567 --> 14:25.659
What happened?

14:25.768 --> 14:27.861
Uh, isn't this the guard...

14:28.171 --> 14:29.433
Nothing to worry about.

14:29.639 --> 14:30.867
He just fainted.

14:31.240 --> 14:31.729
What?!

14:32.408 --> 14:36.174
Didn't you say that you wanted to
see that wind user guy?

14:39.649 --> 14:40.809
I'll take you to him.

15:00.570 --> 15:01.696
Hey, Shiel.

15:01.771 --> 15:05.400
That camera outside
the Maiden's room isn't working.

15:05.875 --> 15:08.400
You didn't do anything, did you?

15:08.945 --> 15:10.071
Of course not!

15:10.380 --> 15:11.176
Right...

15:13.182 --> 15:15.116
Hey, who is that with you?

15:16.285 --> 15:16.751
Stop it!

15:25.528 --> 15:26.392
The Maiden!

15:31.567 --> 15:33.034
What're you doing, Shiel?!

15:34.037 --> 15:35.061
Let's go!

15:36.673 --> 15:37.298
Hold it!

15:38.007 --> 15:40.976
Emergency alert!
The Maiden is being kidnapped!

15:41.944 --> 15:44.037
All personnel are to mobilize!

15:44.847 --> 15:46.815
All personnel are to mobilize!

15:50.253 --> 15:53.086
Her abductor is the thunder user,
Shiel Messiah!

15:53.756 --> 15:55.246
She is betraying the Company!

15:55.658 --> 15:57.592
Do not let her out of the building!

15:58.327 --> 15:59.453
Don't let her get away!

16:00.263 --> 16:02.231
Thunder Wall Formation!

16:07.603 --> 16:08.331
It's no good!

16:08.404 --> 16:09.462
We can't get near her!

16:10.106 --> 16:11.130
She may be a mere kid...

16:11.207 --> 16:12.970
...but she's also
a formidable power user!

16:13.309 --> 16:14.970
Close the emergency doors!

16:18.715 --> 16:20.080
They're going to trap us!

16:28.024 --> 16:28.956
Now!

16:29.025 --> 16:29.650
Yes!

16:41.804 --> 16:43.101
How inept.

16:44.907 --> 16:45.839
Oh, right.

16:46.542 --> 16:48.806
I'd better get in touch
with the Company.

16:50.079 --> 16:51.842
You're going to turn us in now?!

16:52.148 --> 16:56.642
If we did that, we'd have
to hand over Miss Rorec as well.

16:57.553 --> 17:00.317
We were in the middle of
our mission.

17:00.490 --> 17:03.152
We could cause a ruckus
if we don't tell them we're okay.

17:03.593 --> 17:07.085
Oh, maybe I should put in for
my vacation time while I'm at it.

17:07.163 --> 17:09.688
Isn't your mission to capture us?

17:10.500 --> 17:11.194
No.

17:11.467 --> 17:14.334
Our mission was to catch and
bring back the warrior who...

17:14.403 --> 17:17.566
...without permission,
went out to fight with Teil.

17:17.940 --> 17:18.668
Warrior?

17:19.342 --> 17:22.311
She was the president
of the Chelsea Rorec Fan Club.

17:22.378 --> 17:25.609
She's got dark skin,
and has curly hair like this!

17:26.449 --> 17:28.007
You mean, her?!

17:30.453 --> 17:31.215
How strange.

17:31.687 --> 17:33.552
I can't get in touch
with the Company.

17:40.797 --> 17:44.289
It's believed that Shiel is in
the vicinity of the 18th level!

17:45.234 --> 17:46.428
Have we got electricity back?

17:47.203 --> 17:48.727
It'll take some time yet.

17:49.605 --> 17:50.333
I see.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.737
Lower the barrier walls.

17:52.809 --> 17:54.538
Make sure we don't let them out!

17:54.644 --> 17:55.201
Yes, sir!

18:00.449 --> 18:01.074
Pairon...

18:06.389 --> 18:09.017
I am responsible for the Maiden.

18:09.892 --> 18:12.087
Leave this one to me.

18:13.162 --> 18:16.791
I don't think you should let
your personal pride interfere.

18:16.866 --> 18:19.994
Bringing back the Maiden
is the top priority here.

18:21.971 --> 18:26.840
The one who let them get away in
the first place said the same thing.

18:30.379 --> 18:33.143
Leave this one to me.

18:40.990 --> 18:41.854
Shiel...

18:42.124 --> 18:43.148
This way's no good.

18:52.969 --> 18:56.461
This could be dangerous,
but I'll just have to try.

19:03.379 --> 19:04.277
Get on!

19:04.347 --> 19:04.870
Right!

19:13.356 --> 19:18.316
This can take us straight down to
the cargo bay in the basement.

19:19.028 --> 19:22.691
By the time those soldiers
realize that...

19:22.765 --> 19:25.097
...we'll already be
outside the building.

19:34.310 --> 19:35.800
No one's here. It's clear!

19:42.852 --> 19:43.784
This way!

19:51.260 --> 19:53.160
Where are you going?

20:06.342 --> 20:07.536
Pairon...

20:08.711 --> 20:12.408
I didn't give you permission
to take the Maiden out.

20:13.382 --> 20:15.077
Stay back, sis!

20:15.551 --> 20:16.347
Shiel...

20:18.854 --> 20:22.984
You really care about the Maiden,
don't you...

20:23.059 --> 20:24.959
...Shiel Messiah.

20:44.380 --> 20:49.147
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.218 --> 20:55.214
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.291 --> 21:07.135
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.437 --> 21:19.314
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.382 --> 21:30.657
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.660 --> 21:40.500
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.569 --> 21:44.403
kikou to shita

21:44.473 --> 21:52.505
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.581 --> 22:01.011
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:12.701 --> 22:15.761
Shiel, that's enough.

22:15.838 --> 22:17.533
Why do you have to fight?

22:18.674 --> 22:21.336
Everyone's getting hurt
because of me.

22:22.545 --> 22:25.480
I don't want to see
anyone else get hurt!

22:26.348 --> 22:30.341
I can't just leave you here
and escape on my own.

22:31.520 --> 22:34.148
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.223 --> 22:35.958
..."The Promise of the Ribbons."

22:35.958 --> 22:37.326
The Promise of the Ribbons
..."The Promise of the Ribbons."

22:37.326 --> 22:40.318
The Promise of the Ribbons
